  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p><strong>• About our brand and products:</strong><br>Weena makes protein bars that feel like real snacks.<br>Soft texture, real Swiss chocolate, less than 1g sugar and 12g protein per bar. Plant-based.<br>No typical “fitness bar” vibe. Just good taste first.</p><p><strong>• What makes us different:</strong><br>Most protein bars are a compromise.<br>Weena isn’t.<br>We focus on taste, texture and simple ingredients. Plant-based, but you wouldn’t guess.</p><p><strong>• How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Affiliates earn 15% commission on every sale made through their link or code.<br>Your audience also gets 10% off, which helps convert.</p><p><strong>• How to promote us:</strong><br>Share your personal link or discount code on social media, in your bio, stories or content.<br>Works especially well with honest reviews, taste tests or casual everyday moments.</p><p><strong>• Other information:</strong><br>Weena is a growing brand with a strong focus on product quality and clean positioning.<br>Fast shipping across Europe and Switzerland. Not in the UK (for now).<br>We’re happy to support you with content or samples if needed.</p></div></div>",
